WEBVTT

02:51.041 --> 02:52.914
[Do Kyung]

02:58.250 --> 03:00.375
Here you go.

03:00.375 --> 03:02.708
It's so pretty!

03:02.708 --> 03:05.958
This is why I only order
when you're working!

03:05.958 --> 03:09.643
Your arrangements are
way better than the boss's,

03:09.643 --> 03:12.145
you've got that touch.

03:12.145 --> 03:14.398
You can come anytime from now on.

03:14.398 --> 03:16.598
I'm taking over the shop.

03:17.333 --> 03:19.236
So you'll be the boss?

03:19.236 --> 03:20.696
Yes.

03:20.696 --> 03:23.104
Congratulations!

03:24.533 --> 03:28.041
Are you ignoring my calls?

03:28.041 --> 03:29.700
We're late.

03:32.833 --> 03:35.958
Why do you bother buying flowers?

03:35.958 --> 03:37.974
They'll wither anyway.

03:37.974 --> 03:39.082
It's fine.

03:39.082 --> 03:41.999
That's just how my friend talks.

03:41.999 --> 03:44.707
Hello.

03:44.707 --> 03:46.096
Going on a trip?

03:46.096 --> 03:47.832
Yes.

03:47.832 --> 03:48.957
Where?

03:48.957 --> 03:52.124
Backpacking through Europe,
here and there.

03:52.124 --> 03:54.332
Are you taking flowers
to the airport?

03:54.332 --> 03:57.666
It's my mom's birthday,
but I can't be there, so...

03:57.666 --> 04:00.124
- I see.
- Thank you.

04:00.124 --> 04:02.032
Come back soon.

04:04.666 --> 04:07.291
Jealous much?

04:07.291 --> 04:09.207
As if.

04:09.207 --> 04:11.737
Come on, you're late.

04:21.207 --> 04:24.166
The rental shop was cleaned out,
that's all they had left.

04:24.166 --> 04:29.791
It's not about what I wear,
it's about how much I make today.

04:29.791 --> 04:31.916
Oh please.

04:31.916 --> 04:33.699
Moron.

04:35.582 --> 04:38.832
Look how busy Hwajoong Market is.

04:38.832 --> 04:42.532
Thank God it's my last day.
I'm so done.

04:43.874 --> 04:46.374
I told you not to smoke in the car!

04:46.374 --> 04:47.999
I opened the window!

04:47.999 --> 04:49.416
Put it out!

04:49.416 --> 04:50.666
Just one drag.

04:50.666 --> 04:54.249
- Put it out.
- Come on, just one drag!

04:54.249 --> 04:56.374
The car's gonna reek!

04:56.374 --> 04:58.124
It already reeks of cigarettes.

04:58.124 --> 05:01.324
Stop being a bitch,
just put it out!

05:03.958 --> 05:05.499
Let me get a drag.

05:05.499 --> 05:08.074
Unbelievable.

05:10.458 --> 05:12.074
Give it back.

05:12.833 --> 05:14.999
You bitch, I'll kill you.

05:14.999 --> 05:16.499
Come on!

05:16.499 --> 05:18.574
Your precious car is so damn clean.

05:28.458 --> 05:29.874
Someone's gonna get hurt.

05:29.874 --> 05:32.366
Is she insane?

05:35.413 --> 05:37.708
You always amaze me.

05:40.544 --> 05:42.416
Dobby!

05:42.416 --> 05:45.041
I lost 7kg thanks to this.

05:45.041 --> 05:48.666
You're so much faster
than overseas orders.

05:48.666 --> 05:52.722
If you like it so much,
spread the word.

05:52.722 --> 05:54.958
30% off per referral!

05:54.958 --> 05:57.124
30%? Okay, I'll spread the word!

05:57.124 --> 05:58.499
- Later.
- Bye.

05:58.499 --> 06:02.574
You're a natural,
you were made for this job.

06:02.574 --> 06:04.291
It's just business.

06:04.291 --> 06:06.324
Hurry up and drive.

06:29.384 --> 06:31.293
Ye Seul's clocking in.

06:37.351 --> 06:39.083
Dobby!

06:39.083 --> 06:41.625
Shit...

06:41.625 --> 06:42.875
Got a lot of gigs?

06:42.875 --> 06:44.125
Get out.

06:44.125 --> 06:45.583
Don't be like that.

06:45.583 --> 06:48.000
I got you a sweet gig
in the capital markets.

06:48.000 --> 06:49.458
I'm busy, get out.

06:49.458 --> 06:51.197
No, it's cold out.

06:51.197 --> 06:52.958
Are you insane?

06:52.958 --> 06:55.208
All you ever have
are sketchy gigs.

06:55.208 --> 06:59.042
This one's clean.

06:59.042 --> 07:02.458
Get one of your goons to do it,
don't come at me.

07:02.458 --> 07:06.042
Cops are sniffing around
like crazy lately.

07:06.042 --> 07:08.125
I got no one.

07:08.125 --> 07:11.208
But you're squeaky clean.

07:11.208 --> 07:14.917
And despite that temper,
you got no priors too.

07:14.917 --> 07:16.765
Shut your face.

07:16.765 --> 07:18.613
I'll pay double!

07:18.613 --> 07:20.612
Should I call the cops?

07:22.125 --> 07:23.688
Okay, okay.

07:23.688 --> 07:26.441
Be a chauffeur all your life.

07:27.275 --> 07:29.069
Millionaire in a million years!

07:31.958 --> 07:34.867
Fucking moron.

07:56.042 --> 07:57.167
Rock, paper, scissors!

07:57.167 --> 07:59.533
Rock, paper, scissors! Okay!

08:02.500 --> 08:08.350
Rock, paper, scissors!
You suck at this.

08:08.350 --> 08:11.833
The self-made goddess returns.

08:11.833 --> 08:16.301
She lives off beans and rice
working as a florist.

08:16.301 --> 08:17.750
Her skills are next-level.

08:17.750 --> 08:19.667
Ye Seul!

08:19.667 --> 08:23.125
You should get dolled up
at the salon, it doesn't cost much.

08:23.125 --> 08:24.542
Like hell she will.

08:24.542 --> 08:28.208
She saved up like crazy,

08:28.208 --> 08:30.833
so she's retiring end of this week.

08:30.833 --> 08:35.667
She took over the flower shop,
and deposited $700,000 for a house.

08:35.667 --> 08:37.876
Hwa Jin, aren't you jealous?

08:37.876 --> 08:39.876
It's pathetic to be jealous.

08:39.876 --> 08:41.709
Stop!

08:41.709 --> 08:43.667
I'm not jealous.

08:43.667 --> 08:45.959
Once she's gone, I'll be the ace.

08:45.959 --> 08:47.084
Bullshit.

08:47.084 --> 08:50.775
You'll make chump change
running a flower shop.

08:50.775 --> 08:51.917
Can you live on that?

08:51.917 --> 08:54.584
I want to sleep at night
and work during the day now.

08:54.584 --> 08:56.292
Like normal people.

08:56.292 --> 08:58.334
Anyway, give me a smoke!

08:58.334 --> 09:00.202
Dammit.

09:00.202 --> 09:01.542
Take it easy.

09:01.542 --> 09:02.792
Thank you.

09:02.792 --> 09:07.876
That blue "No Escort" bracelet
is annoying as hell.

09:07.876 --> 09:09.586
- Ye Seul.
- Yeah?

09:09.586 --> 09:13.298
Your face isn't giving today.

09:13.298 --> 09:15.706
- You're giving less.
- Shut up.

09:17.417 --> 09:18.893
[Photos: On This Day]

09:18.893 --> 09:20.646
[7 Years Ago Today]

09:21.890 --> 09:23.308
What is it?

09:23.308 --> 09:25.101
Isn't that Ga Young?

09:25.101 --> 09:26.478
How is she doing?

09:26.478 --> 09:28.105
Remember when she
first brought you here-

09:28.105 --> 09:30.263
I'm sure she's fine.

09:31.191 --> 09:33.251
Right, probably.

09:33.251 --> 09:34.819
Who is she?

09:34.819 --> 09:36.696
She was a legend around here.

09:36.696 --> 09:41.493
I heard she blackmailed
some Japanese ambassador.

09:41.493 --> 09:45.914
Why don't ambassadors
ever come to our shop?

09:45.914 --> 09:49.417
I don't care for government
officials or foreigners.

09:49.417 --> 09:51.336
You know jack shit.

09:51.336 --> 09:54.745
Ambassadors don't even get
checked at customs.

09:54.745 --> 09:56.002
Perfect for luxury shopping trips.

09:56.002 --> 09:59.002
Boss arriving in 7 minutes.
Standby, Sang Ok.

09:59.002 --> 10:01.786
Alright, let's get ready!
The boss is coming!

10:02.598 --> 10:05.141
You know we got
a new boss, right?

10:05.141 --> 10:06.377
A new boss?

10:06.377 --> 10:08.961
"Blackjack" made bank in the
Philippines off sports betting,

10:08.961 --> 10:13.794
he just came back and bought up
Gangnam joints, including ours.

10:13.794 --> 10:16.002
So, who's gonna
work the boss's room?

10:16.002 --> 10:18.488
It's an important meeting
with a basketball coach.

10:18.488 --> 10:20.658
Let's stay sharp.

10:22.502 --> 10:24.794
The plant at the entrance.

10:24.794 --> 10:26.044
Sorry?

10:26.044 --> 10:27.961
It's wilting.

10:27.961 --> 10:31.327
All green except the second one
from the front.

10:34.044 --> 10:36.752
If you can't manage it,
just get rid of it.

10:36.752 --> 10:39.494
And space the pots evenly.

10:40.169 --> 10:41.911
Yes, sir.

10:42.377 --> 10:44.169
Now.

10:44.169 --> 10:46.994
Right now? Of course!

10:53.502 --> 10:55.119
Sit.

11:10.919 --> 11:14.961
Sir, basketball's tough.

11:14.961 --> 11:17.130
It's really tough.

11:17.130 --> 11:19.711
It looks like a team sport.

11:19.711 --> 11:23.127
But depending on which players
you use and when,

11:23.127 --> 11:26.161
the whole flow of
the game can shift.

11:26.807 --> 11:28.851
Hey.

11:28.851 --> 11:30.384
Don't drag the glass.

11:32.127 --> 11:36.077
Boss, you're so sensitive.

11:38.502 --> 11:40.409
Move.

11:42.877 --> 11:45.041
You, switch seats with her.

11:45.575 --> 11:47.504
You two switch.

11:48.586 --> 11:50.411
Yes, sir.

11:56.586 --> 12:00.502
That's why you need
a seasoned coach like me.

12:00.502 --> 12:02.884
And with my team's ace,
Han Wook, on our side,

12:02.884 --> 12:07.002
we can control the game
however you want.

12:07.002 --> 12:11.294
He'll follow my orders to a T.

12:11.294 --> 12:15.369
Sir, trust me and invest in us.

12:19.067 --> 12:24.336
Looking down on me like that,
what a rude little shit.

12:24.336 --> 12:27.294
65 to 59, loss...

12:27.294 --> 12:30.203
I got it all, asshole!

12:30.203 --> 12:35.590
Once the big money hits,
you'll be mine!

12:35.590 --> 12:38.086
I'll make you rich!

12:38.086 --> 12:40.669
I'll save you.

12:40.669 --> 12:42.252
- I'm on your side, okay?
- This way, sir.

12:42.252 --> 12:44.327
Have a good night!

12:47.012 --> 12:48.853
Isn't it funny?

12:50.056 --> 12:53.090
Who's saving who
when we're all the same?

12:54.019 --> 12:56.585
Your life is yours to save.

13:00.650 --> 13:02.475
Thanks, hon!

13:02.961 --> 13:05.294
[Hundered Percenter]
[Congrats / Payout Rate: 2.60 / Winnings: $910]

13:05.294 --> 13:09.536
- Who the fuck cares if he's the boss?
- Yes!

13:13.037 --> 13:16.499
Nice! It's my lucky day,

13:16.499 --> 13:18.251
I got you as my driver.

13:18.251 --> 13:20.795
Get out, I'm booked up.

13:20.795 --> 13:23.128
You pick and choose
your clients now?

13:23.128 --> 13:25.092
I'm seriously hurt.

13:25.092 --> 13:27.795
What is the matter with you?

13:27.795 --> 13:29.495
Wipe it.

13:30.920 --> 13:32.503
Wipe the floor!

13:32.503 --> 13:34.222
Dammit!

13:34.795 --> 13:36.503
Wipe it clean.

13:36.503 --> 13:39.503
Dammit, treating me like shit
because you're retiring?

13:39.503 --> 13:42.003
Do you even know
who I just drank with?

13:42.003 --> 13:45.712
Basketball coach Choi Chul!
And Blackjack!

13:45.712 --> 13:49.949
65 to 59, his team loses.

13:49.949 --> 13:52.619
Bet against his team.

13:53.212 --> 13:58.337
You'll win the bet 100%.

13:58.337 --> 14:03.412
Ye Seul was there too, ask her yourself...

14:04.003 --> 14:05.662
Hey!

14:08.468 --> 14:14.933
Let's just go, drive...

14:19.062 --> 14:20.786
[Choi Offed Himself!]

14:23.150 --> 14:26.091
[He Turned Out To Be A Housing Scammer!]

14:38.832 --> 14:41.204
That fucker took off.

14:42.336 --> 14:44.337
Ye Seul!

14:44.337 --> 14:47.045
You signed a lease
for Mr. Choi's condo, right?

14:47.045 --> 14:51.337
Weren't you moving in this week?
Look at this, is this true?

14:51.337 --> 14:54.870
All girls in Hwajoong Market got scammed!

14:59.045 --> 15:02.503
Does anyone know
where this motherfucker is?

15:02.503 --> 15:04.295
[Memorial Room: Choi Seung Beom (Male, 31)]
It was all a setup!

15:04.295 --> 15:05.420
It was all a setup!

15:05.420 --> 15:10.245
He baited girls like us
with cheap leases.

15:11.045 --> 15:15.578
He gambled away your money!

15:18.961 --> 15:21.661
This fucker's really dead?

15:26.545 --> 15:28.461
Excuse me.

15:28.461 --> 15:31.245
What are you doing?

15:36.503 --> 15:38.003
- What are you doing? Get up!
- Dammit!

15:38.003 --> 15:39.393
Out! Get out!

15:39.393 --> 15:41.218
Please leave!

15:41.753 --> 15:44.336
Get the hell out!

15:44.336 --> 15:48.620
What the hell do you think
you're doing at a funeral?

15:49.170 --> 15:50.911
Goddammit!

15:51.628 --> 15:54.753
- No!
- Is she insane? Please stop!

15:54.753 --> 15:56.703
Fuck off!

15:58.003 --> 16:01.620
Let that go!
Let's just talk!

16:02.920 --> 16:05.286
I said stop it!

16:39.536 --> 16:42.261
We have to survive somehow.

16:50.255 --> 16:53.377
Let's hang on with
the flower shop deposit.

16:57.796 --> 16:59.341
Hey.

17:03.529 --> 17:06.351
Did you drink with
Blackjack today?

17:07.648 --> 17:09.634
What about it?

17:18.075 --> 17:19.802
Nothing.

17:28.168 --> 17:30.350
[YD Gangnam Bank: $100,000 Withdrawn]

17:30.838 --> 17:32.920
Dammit!

17:32.920 --> 17:36.169
They don't have much time left.

17:36.169 --> 17:38.211
Hurry and take a seat.

17:38.211 --> 17:40.078
Goddammit...

17:43.336 --> 17:44.850
What was that for?

17:44.850 --> 17:49.106
Do Kyung, why is
our bank account empty?

17:57.239 --> 17:59.874
You didn't bet it
all on this, did you?

18:03.619 --> 18:05.710
- Come sit down.
- You're full of shit.

18:05.710 --> 18:07.252
Sit down for a sec!

18:07.252 --> 18:09.335
What the hell for?

18:09.335 --> 18:11.543
- Look at this!
- Look at what?

18:11.543 --> 18:13.293
I bet against them, and if they lose

18:13.293 --> 18:15.543
by six points, we win it all.

18:15.543 --> 18:17.002
That's total bullshit...

18:17.002 --> 18:19.002
It's a sure thing.

18:19.002 --> 18:21.710
How much deeper are you
gonna bury us?

18:21.710 --> 18:24.421
I'm trying to keep us
from getting buried.

18:25.627 --> 18:27.252
Have you ever seen me
bet this much before?

18:27.252 --> 18:29.127
This is insane...

18:29.127 --> 18:32.210
You know this tip is legit.

18:32.210 --> 18:35.377
You heard that coach yammer
to Blackjack, didn't you?

18:35.377 --> 18:37.960
I'm so done with you!

18:37.960 --> 18:39.002
Look at it!

18:39.002 --> 18:41.910
We've got this in the bag!

18:42.418 --> 18:44.002
Almost there.

18:44.002 --> 18:48.081
65 to 59, just gotta keep
the six-point gap.

18:48.081 --> 18:53.460
65 to 59. He's bringing in
Lee Han Wook for a win.

18:53.460 --> 18:56.960
Kinda late to sub in your best player.

18:56.960 --> 18:59.835
Lee is replacing Hong Dong Myung.

18:59.835 --> 19:01.252
Lee takes his shot!

19:01.252 --> 19:03.502
Lee Han Wook's 3-pointer!
It's short.

19:03.502 --> 19:05.168
He misses his first shot.

19:05.168 --> 19:10.543
Coach Choi brought him in late,
so he must be feeling the pressure.

19:10.543 --> 19:13.002
No, don't score!

19:13.002 --> 19:15.877
Lee is on the move, he's got the ball.

19:15.877 --> 19:17.877
He aims for the rim!
Lee Han Wook again!

19:17.877 --> 19:20.952
- Don't you dare.
- Lee Han Wook shoots!

19:21.377 --> 19:23.585
Lee shoots and misses.

19:23.585 --> 19:25.085
Yes!

19:25.085 --> 19:26.960
Fuck yes!

19:26.960 --> 19:29.835
Holy shit!

19:29.835 --> 19:31.293
Hey, hey!

19:31.293 --> 19:33.627
- Did we win?
- Yes!

19:33.627 --> 19:35.618
So? Did it work?

19:38.335 --> 19:42.535
We did it! We fucking did it!

19:43.502 --> 19:45.377
I told you it'd work.

19:45.377 --> 19:47.418
One shot and we're back on top!

19:47.418 --> 19:50.601
Thank you, thank you...

19:50.601 --> 19:52.085
Thank you...

19:52.085 --> 19:54.085
Thank you God, thank you...

19:54.085 --> 19:56.877
[Cash Out Request]
I just need to cash out.

19:56.877 --> 19:58.868
Cash out, cash out.

20:01.585 --> 20:03.535
What's this?

20:05.585 --> 20:07.368
What is it?

20:08.543 --> 20:12.689
This isn't funny, cut it out!

20:15.168 --> 20:19.260
[Notice: We took all the money.
Thx for the love. Report us if you want LOL]

20:24.418 --> 20:26.929
Yo, Dobby. What's up?

20:26.929 --> 20:28.877
Can I still do that gig
you mentioned?

20:28.877 --> 20:32.243
Gig? What gig?

20:33.252 --> 20:36.452
The gig you mentioned!
Can I still take it?

20:37.585 --> 20:40.793
Word is you and Mi Sun got wiped out.

20:40.793 --> 20:44.168
You talked big about retiring,
now look at you.

20:44.168 --> 20:47.077
Total crash and burn.

20:48.043 --> 20:50.535
Give me three times the pay.

20:52.621 --> 20:54.543
Then I'll do it.

20:54.543 --> 20:58.785
The gigolo bar at 9 tonight.

21:09.293 --> 21:11.877
- You're late!
- Piss off!

21:11.877 --> 21:15.202
Don't be like that,
these people are busy.

21:16.293 --> 21:17.668
Bottoms up!

21:17.668 --> 21:18.710
Having fun?

21:18.710 --> 21:21.043
- What's up?
- Hey, Seok Gu!

21:21.043 --> 21:25.259
Ye Seul, these gents
are my business bros.

21:25.259 --> 21:30.118
Over there is my big boss,
CEO Ahn Joon Min.

21:30.743 --> 21:33.585
He's never been to
these high-end bars.

21:33.585 --> 21:38.626
Boss! How do you like her?
She's the hottest chick here.

21:38.626 --> 21:41.876
But a total train wreck.

21:41.876 --> 21:45.001
She's hot but dumb as fuck.

21:45.001 --> 21:46.501
Fine, fine, fine!

21:46.501 --> 21:49.210
I'm kidding, come in.

21:49.709 --> 21:51.126
Move.

21:51.126 --> 21:52.459
Go away.

21:52.459 --> 21:53.959
- Scoot over.
- Excuse me, watch your feet.

21:53.959 --> 21:55.876
Ow! You stepped on me!

21:55.876 --> 21:57.604
Move over!

21:57.604 --> 21:59.584
- Alright, alright!
- Seriously?

21:59.584 --> 22:04.501
I set this up to intro a great
biz opportunity to Ye Seul.

22:04.501 --> 22:07.834
Boss, cheers!

22:07.834 --> 22:09.576
Mr. Ahn.

22:10.293 --> 22:13.212
How is it? Killer, right?

22:13.917 --> 22:20.751
Ye Seul. Me and my bros will help
you launch your Onlyfans career.

22:20.751 --> 22:23.084
We'll take care of it!

22:23.084 --> 22:26.909
Forget about the scam,
just be prepared.

22:29.292 --> 22:30.917
Ye Seul.

22:30.917 --> 22:34.667
Wear the red! Escort a little!

22:34.667 --> 22:39.576
Accept reality and
know your place in it.

22:42.042 --> 22:43.626
I'm outta here, guys!

22:43.626 --> 22:45.792
Enjoy yourself, boss!

22:45.792 --> 22:48.667
You ladies take care of my bros.

22:48.667 --> 22:51.117
Cash pops here!

23:12.667 --> 23:14.659
Christ...

23:21.126 --> 23:22.917
I might not be able to
come here for a while.

23:22.917 --> 23:24.459
All of a sudden?

23:24.459 --> 23:26.959
My husband's getting audited.

23:26.959 --> 23:30.989
He secretly moved his cash
to Gyeonggi somewhere.

23:30.989 --> 23:33.897
I'm broke, I can't come here now.

23:36.792 --> 23:39.459
This is way too random.

23:39.459 --> 23:41.742
Are you breaking up with me?

23:44.834 --> 23:48.701
Baby, let's meet up
somewhere else, privately.

23:50.209 --> 23:53.959
Guys like us get flagged
if we meet clients outside.

23:53.959 --> 23:57.284
You're broke.
You sure you can handle me?

24:00.376 --> 24:02.792
You little hustler!

24:02.792 --> 24:07.492
How much have I spent
on our time and bond?

24:08.169 --> 24:10.994
Put out that cigarette,
you fucker.

24:12.751 --> 24:14.398
Okay.

24:15.209 --> 24:16.709
Okay, baby.

24:16.709 --> 24:19.625
Let's meet up outside.

24:19.625 --> 24:22.542
How bad did your husband fuck up

24:22.542 --> 24:24.750
for you to not be able
to come here?

24:24.750 --> 24:27.125
Seung Won.

24:27.125 --> 24:29.715
Snap out of it.

24:29.715 --> 24:32.405
Just do as I tell you.

24:32.875 --> 24:36.709
Fuck, I got her wasted
like there's no tomorrow...

24:36.709 --> 24:37.875
The fuck.

24:37.875 --> 24:40.000
So, gentlemen,
make any money lately?

24:40.000 --> 24:43.125
It's been fucking forever
since I got laid, man.

24:43.125 --> 24:44.417
No trust fund bimbos in a bit?

24:44.417 --> 24:45.792
Hurry up before
you're dried up, moron.

24:45.792 --> 24:47.625
Go get 'em bimbos!

24:47.625 --> 24:48.667
You came here yourself?

24:48.667 --> 24:50.542
I got some business too.

24:50.542 --> 24:53.375
Appointments with clients
are all about safety.

24:53.375 --> 24:55.334
You should take
Blackjack's $700,000.

24:55.334 --> 24:57.534
Pay off the loan sharks
and your debt.

24:57.534 --> 24:59.494
Rob him and get killed?

24:59.494 --> 25:01.995
Idiot, you'll die
one way or another.

25:01.995 --> 25:04.042
If it's the last train,
might as well ride first class.

25:04.042 --> 25:05.875
Fuck off.

25:05.875 --> 25:08.742
Give me a smoke
and lay out the details.

25:09.459 --> 25:10.709
Dude.

25:10.709 --> 25:14.750
My client is Blackjack's wife,

25:14.750 --> 25:17.625
and she said he stashed $700,000
in slush funds in Gyeonggi somewhere.

25:17.625 --> 25:19.459
You should wipe him out.

25:19.459 --> 25:20.917
You're actually serious?

25:20.917 --> 25:25.450
I'll handle the digging.
You seal the deal and take 60%.

25:26.209 --> 25:27.784
Deal.

25:28.792 --> 25:30.200
Okay.

25:30.834 --> 25:32.742
I'll be in touch.

25:34.875 --> 25:39.200
Use the goods,
she'll spill everything!

25:51.000 --> 25:52.083
Hey, Dobby.

25:52.083 --> 25:54.016
Sit beside me.

26:06.917 --> 26:08.625
Just look at you.

26:08.625 --> 26:12.417
Do this gig right,
and you'll be rolling in cash.

26:12.417 --> 26:13.992
Here.

26:24.333 --> 26:26.492
Drive safe!

26:28.208 --> 26:30.647
$2,000 a shot?

26:31.750 --> 26:35.325
That's capitalist romance
in the best sense.

26:36.917 --> 26:40.242
Shall I throw in another
$2,000 for another round?

27:20.875 --> 27:22.750
Baby, let's go.

27:22.750 --> 27:24.408
Babe!

27:24.958 --> 27:28.200
Babe, babe!

27:30.187 --> 27:32.086
Give me a hand?

27:34.358 --> 27:36.641
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

27:37.694 --> 27:39.390
Baby!

27:40.571 --> 27:43.125
Get up, come on.

27:43.125 --> 27:45.500
Get the fuck up!

27:45.500 --> 27:47.575
Let's go, alright.

27:48.250 --> 27:52.125
What'll I do without seeing
this pretty face?

27:52.125 --> 27:57.992
I can quit drugs,
but I can't quit you.

28:01.009 --> 28:03.043
So, baby...

28:04.041 --> 28:05.958
That thing you mentioned,
can't we just take it?

28:05.958 --> 28:08.083
That thing? What's that?

28:08.083 --> 28:11.166
Your husband's slush fund.

28:11.166 --> 28:14.791
If we get that, we can meet
freely outside too.

28:14.791 --> 28:18.325
You know where it's hidden, right?

28:19.125 --> 28:20.416
I dunno!

28:20.416 --> 28:22.208
Don't be like that.

28:22.208 --> 28:23.458
I dunno!

28:23.458 --> 28:26.833
- You must have a clue.
- Nope!

28:26.833 --> 28:29.958
Okay, okay. I really love you.

28:29.958 --> 28:32.000
I love you, baby!

28:32.000 --> 28:33.791
So much!

28:33.791 --> 28:38.422
I love you, love you!

28:38.422 --> 28:43.750
My hubby bought
some land in Gyeonggi.

28:43.750 --> 28:49.908
So, the place where
he buried the $700,000 is...

28:51.625 --> 28:54.491
Stop! Pull over for a bit!

28:58.750 --> 29:01.333
Fuck. You okay?

29:01.333 --> 29:04.666
You okay, baby?

29:04.666 --> 29:06.408
Babe?

29:26.442 --> 29:29.250
Call me when you get the location.

29:29.250 --> 29:33.458
I'll have everything ready to go.

29:33.458 --> 29:38.575
Ye Seul's video debut is
coming tonight, get hyped.

29:51.666 --> 29:53.916
Hey, where the fuck
are you going?

29:53.916 --> 29:57.333
Easy there, hold on.
We're almost there.

29:57.333 --> 29:59.208
So close, almost there.

29:59.208 --> 30:02.991
Keep it together! Hold on!

30:03.416 --> 30:06.666
Got a headache, eh?

30:06.666 --> 30:10.958
Let's take a break
and make some art.

30:10.958 --> 30:13.875
- Let go!
- It's fine, good girl.

30:13.875 --> 30:15.083
- Let go of me!
- It's alright.

30:15.083 --> 30:17.241
Let go!

30:20.691 --> 30:22.631
I let go, bitch!

30:23.624 --> 30:28.699
Get off your high horse and
work it while you're still in demand!

31:10.291 --> 31:12.574
Give me a cigarette.

31:27.582 --> 31:30.249
Seok Gu's gonna steal
Blackjack's money.

31:30.249 --> 31:31.957
$700,000 in cash.

31:31.957 --> 31:34.624
Same as what we lost.

31:34.624 --> 31:39.032
I'll steal it and pay you back,
so don't worry.

31:43.124 --> 31:46.527
That son of a bitch is no joke.

31:46.527 --> 31:49.680
If we screw up,
we could die for real.

31:51.166 --> 31:53.892
You said we gotta
survive somehow.

31:54.533 --> 31:57.955
Can you do this shit
for four more years?

32:08.415 --> 32:10.248
Let's do it together.

32:10.248 --> 32:12.902
I'll dig into him a bit.

32:21.457 --> 32:24.615
You think Seok Gu's
already grabbed it?

32:26.123 --> 32:27.957
So what's the plan?

32:27.957 --> 32:30.198
Disarm him.

32:47.832 --> 32:50.373
That place is also Blackjack's?

32:50.373 --> 32:51.790
Yeah.

32:51.790 --> 32:55.532
Watch out for that bitch next to him.

32:55.957 --> 33:00.415
"Bull" cleans up all his dirty work.

33:00.415 --> 33:04.032
She'll make you a cripple
or disappear.

33:05.082 --> 33:06.782
Here I go.

33:07.620 --> 33:09.526
Mi Sun.

33:09.526 --> 33:11.570
Make sure he doesn't
see your face.

33:11.570 --> 33:13.270
Okay.

33:47.340 --> 33:51.318
You're here?
Can't you be on time, goddammit.

33:51.318 --> 33:53.935
Fucking hell.

34:00.202 --> 34:04.039
That OCD of yours!
So fucking annoying!

34:04.039 --> 34:05.791
Boss, why are you
so damn picky?

34:05.791 --> 34:09.250
No matter how much I drink here,
I never get drunk!

34:09.250 --> 34:10.671
Isn't that weird?

34:10.671 --> 34:12.464
Is it because the chicks are hot?

34:12.464 --> 34:15.507
But the more you drink,
the more sober you get!

34:15.507 --> 34:16.800
- Welcome back, sir.
- Hi.

34:16.800 --> 34:17.832
Good evening.

34:17.832 --> 34:20.207
Give me my leftover bottle
from last time.

34:20.207 --> 34:23.915
Sexy whiskey, sexy chicks!

34:23.915 --> 34:26.332
I'll have it ready.

34:26.332 --> 34:27.373
You got hotter.

34:27.373 --> 34:29.415
- Hurry, hurry!
- You're too much!

34:29.415 --> 34:32.407
How does she get hotter
in just two days?

34:46.665 --> 34:48.457
Excuse me.

34:48.457 --> 34:49.665
May I sit down?

34:49.665 --> 34:53.240
Dayum! Welcome, welcome!

34:53.790 --> 34:57.582
Sit down, join us!

34:57.582 --> 35:00.374
Wearing black lingerie?
Black panther vibes!

35:00.374 --> 35:01.316
- So hot.
- Baby!

35:01.316 --> 35:02.748
- Holy shit.
- Hi, baby.

35:02.748 --> 35:04.540
I like you, approved!

35:04.540 --> 35:07.290
Be my wife tonight, honey!

35:07.290 --> 35:09.032
Pour me a drink!

35:15.692 --> 35:17.290
So weird, you're too weird.

35:17.290 --> 35:19.957
You seriously have OCD
or something, right?

35:19.957 --> 35:24.200
Do you lose your shit
if someone touches your shit?

35:24.200 --> 35:27.582
I get so turned on
if someone touches my shit!

35:27.582 --> 35:30.532
Touch me, touch me!

35:34.248 --> 35:36.004
Get your own bottle.

35:36.004 --> 35:39.248
You're being an ass.

35:39.248 --> 35:41.509
How could you be so rude
to our black panther?

35:41.509 --> 35:43.263
Let me treat you then,
have my drink.

35:43.263 --> 35:44.957
What a douchebag.

35:44.957 --> 35:48.831
Don't be cheap,
you're fucking loaded!

35:48.831 --> 35:51.206
You're buying my drink!

35:51.206 --> 35:52.831
You hit the jackpot with
that condo scam!

35:52.831 --> 35:56.198
And you got rid of
that son-of-a-bitch Choi...

36:01.373 --> 36:03.364
Alright...

36:07.914 --> 36:09.123
Honey, let's get out of here.

36:09.123 --> 36:11.831
Let's go have fun!
Honey, let's have fun!

36:11.831 --> 36:13.998
Wonderful!

36:13.998 --> 36:16.448
Oh yes!

36:23.748 --> 36:26.098
Showtime!

36:26.098 --> 36:28.048
Honey!

36:46.743 --> 36:49.789
- Take that mask off.
- Why?

36:49.789 --> 36:55.781
Drinking with a chick
hiding her face kills the vibe.

36:58.414 --> 37:01.781
I think it's more
fun this way.

37:11.789 --> 37:14.781
Am I drinking to entertain you?

37:15.331 --> 37:19.997
Then let's go shot-for-shot.

37:19.997 --> 37:23.947
If I lose, I'll take it off.

37:46.539 --> 37:50.989
I'll get the location
from his phone.

37:54.831 --> 37:58.247
Get it done in 30.

37:58.247 --> 38:00.322
Or I'm moving in.

38:28.122 --> 38:30.864
Sorry to bother you, boss...

38:52.035 --> 38:53.954
Are you the car owner?

38:53.954 --> 38:57.830
Sorry, I bumped into it
while backing out.

38:57.830 --> 39:01.628
I wrecked an expensive car, dammit...

39:01.628 --> 39:05.549
I'll get insurance on it right away.

39:05.549 --> 39:06.967
It's alright.

39:06.967 --> 39:11.792
There's no number posted,
at least give me your contact.

39:13.007 --> 39:14.383
It's fine.

39:14.383 --> 39:16.717
Don't change your mind later,
I'll file it properly -

39:16.717 --> 39:18.750
Shit...

39:19.855 --> 39:22.555
I said it's fine, fuck off.

39:26.622 --> 39:29.122
Fucking hell.

39:29.122 --> 39:32.222
What a fucking asshole.

39:32.222 --> 39:35.081
Don't come crying later,
you son of a bitch!

39:35.081 --> 39:37.239
Fuck it, fine by me.

40:39.515 --> 40:45.399
You know your shit.
She's spilling everything!

40:48.193 --> 40:50.026
Blackjack bought a piece of land

40:50.026 --> 40:53.746
to start a private cemetery.

40:53.746 --> 40:58.696
Getting tingly? Right?

40:59.371 --> 41:03.038
It's near Wangsan,
called Cheongong Cemetery.

41:03.038 --> 41:08.780
They rushed it, so no CCTV,
no fucking nothing!

41:35.621 --> 41:37.655
Where are you going?

41:47.753 --> 41:49.421
Shit! I can't do this!

41:49.421 --> 41:50.880
Is this even the right place?

41:50.880 --> 41:55.093
Look, that's a compactor.
This is the spot!

41:55.093 --> 41:56.428
Shut up and keep digging.

41:56.428 --> 41:58.336
Goddammit...

42:01.288 --> 42:03.473
Fucking shit!

42:03.473 --> 42:05.839
What was that?

42:18.538 --> 42:20.280
- Hey!
- Oh shit!

42:47.896 --> 42:49.663
Hang on...

42:49.663 --> 42:52.863
There's something else under this.

43:16.788 --> 43:19.238
It was supposed to be
only $700,000.

43:20.428 --> 43:21.788
$700,000?

43:21.788 --> 43:27.321
That's gotta be
a few million bucks!

43:27.996 --> 43:31.579
It's all blood money anyway,
sucked out of girls like us.

43:31.579 --> 43:32.954
We deserve it.

43:32.954 --> 43:36.496
Yeah, and Blackjack was Choi's backer.

43:36.496 --> 43:40.204
He won't let us off
even if we only took half.

43:40.204 --> 43:42.371
We've got one life to live,
go hard or go home.

43:42.371 --> 43:46.154
Right, go fucking hard.

43:47.621 --> 43:49.038
Stupid ass.

43:49.038 --> 43:50.792
Shut up!

43:56.663 --> 43:58.471
It's Seok Gu.

43:58.471 --> 44:00.254
What?

44:01.288 --> 44:03.845
Fucking bitches...

44:03.845 --> 44:04.954
[Plug]

44:04.954 --> 44:06.613
It's Seok Gu.

44:07.371 --> 44:09.529
Shit, what do we do?

44:17.829 --> 44:19.696
What do we do?

44:21.038 --> 44:22.704
- Let him take the cash.
- What?

44:22.704 --> 44:24.079
Lose the $700,000.

44:24.079 --> 44:26.113
What the hell for?

44:26.579 --> 44:28.038
You trust me, right?

44:28.038 --> 44:30.863
Just stay put, I'll handle it.

44:31.496 --> 44:34.446
Those fucking whores.

44:39.204 --> 44:40.806
Fuck...

44:51.996 --> 44:53.904
Jesus Christ.

45:22.134 --> 45:23.667
Open it.

45:24.926 --> 45:26.763
Open the window!

45:31.204 --> 45:34.996
Is it fun stealing my money,
fucking bitches?

45:34.996 --> 45:36.787
- What money?!
- You cunt!

45:36.787 --> 45:38.746
- What money?!
- You serious?

45:38.746 --> 45:40.662
Here it is! You little bitch.

45:40.662 --> 45:42.954
- Come on!
- What a load of bullshit.

45:42.954 --> 45:44.829
Open up! Open!

45:44.829 --> 45:46.696
Where are you going?

45:48.079 --> 45:49.454
Mi Sun!

45:49.454 --> 45:52.612
Hang on, my leg's stuck!

46:00.797 --> 46:03.289
So fucking slow, are you
high or something?

46:08.889 --> 46:10.474
Let go.

46:10.474 --> 46:13.246
I said, let go!

46:13.246 --> 46:15.154
Pretty please!

46:16.146 --> 46:18.721
Crazy bitch. Shitting yourself?

46:24.162 --> 46:26.162
Die, you son of a bitch!

46:26.162 --> 46:28.029
What the fuck is wrong with you!

46:28.787 --> 46:31.579
Fucking bitch!

46:31.579 --> 46:34.329
Hey, hey!

46:34.329 --> 46:36.029
Cunt!

46:37.829 --> 46:39.496
Dobby.

46:39.496 --> 46:43.279
Goddamn.

46:43.954 --> 46:47.162
No more driving for you.

46:47.162 --> 46:49.071
Don't!

46:53.141 --> 46:56.268
Take this and get lost,
you piece of shit!

47:06.541 --> 47:08.907
You think you're my rival?

47:08.907 --> 47:11.024
Don't kid yourself!

47:12.245 --> 47:13.620
Moron.

47:13.620 --> 47:17.997
You should've chosen
a better partner, Dobby.

47:19.745 --> 47:21.385
I'm off.

47:47.495 --> 47:50.737
You poor ass bitches!

47:52.870 --> 47:54.945
Millionaire in a million years!

48:06.203 --> 48:07.737
That's it!

48:11.537 --> 48:14.287
What a dumbass!

48:14.287 --> 48:17.362
He's a fucking clown!

48:26.411 --> 48:28.078
Are you out of your mind?

48:28.078 --> 48:32.286
Why go overboard
just to lose the money?

48:32.286 --> 48:34.661
So he won't get suspicious.

48:34.661 --> 48:38.411
That prick thinks
we only had $700,000.

48:38.411 --> 48:41.745
He needs to believe that
for us to survive.

48:43.369 --> 48:45.528
We did it.

48:54.078 --> 48:57.661
[Your Grave's Been Robbed]
While Blackjack is chasing Seok Gu...

48:57.661 --> 49:00.495
[Your Wife Knows Who Did It]
we need to get out with the gold.

49:00.495 --> 49:03.195
How are we supposed to sell all this?

49:04.565 --> 49:06.415
Choi Ga Young.

49:07.651 --> 49:09.892
Let's go to mom.

49:37.369 --> 49:40.861
I forgot there's nothing
to eat at home.

49:44.203 --> 49:46.986
How about kimchi fried rice?

49:52.078 --> 49:54.819
Where's my kimchi?

49:58.078 --> 50:01.694
We used to love
kimchi fried rice.

50:02.331 --> 50:06.174
Smash the kimchi
in the frying pan,

50:06.835 --> 50:11.396
throw in some rice and
splash some oyster sauce...

50:11.879 --> 50:14.430
Put the scissors away.

50:14.430 --> 50:16.528
You look insane.

50:22.809 --> 50:24.603
Mom.

50:24.603 --> 50:27.189
We came to
ask you for a favor.

50:27.189 --> 50:29.014
A favor?

50:29.453 --> 50:32.986
That dirt you have on
the Japanese ambassador.

50:33.869 --> 50:35.827
Tell us about that.

50:35.827 --> 50:38.043
Dirt...

50:44.577 --> 50:47.819
That's too bad, it's love.

50:48.286 --> 50:50.694
Do we look like we're joking?

50:58.827 --> 51:00.619
Are we laughing?

51:00.619 --> 51:02.569
Do Kyung!

51:04.494 --> 51:10.452
I gave birth to you at 15,

51:10.452 --> 51:13.194
how dare you
talk to me that way!

51:13.911 --> 51:15.819
Half a million.

51:17.447 --> 51:19.666
I'll give you half a million.

51:20.994 --> 51:24.111
Move a bag to Japan for us.

51:26.577 --> 51:29.036
Triple your offer.

51:29.036 --> 51:30.611
Then I'll do it.

51:33.036 --> 51:34.986
Fine, triple.

51:35.577 --> 51:37.994
But not right away.

51:37.994 --> 51:40.361
I'll pay you in Japan.

51:48.952 --> 51:52.736
Fucked up big time, huh?

52:12.494 --> 52:16.244
These are precious.

52:16.244 --> 52:19.486
This is true romance.

52:34.900 --> 52:37.952
First, go get new passports here.

52:37.952 --> 52:40.531
No point keeping your identities.

52:40.531 --> 52:43.404
How did you find out
about this place?

52:50.827 --> 52:54.235
Maybe I should leave
with my daughters too.

53:08.910 --> 53:11.277
What are you doing alone?

53:15.993 --> 53:18.652
Don't get involved with her.

53:20.660 --> 53:24.402
Get what we need
and cut her loose.

53:33.035 --> 53:36.318
When I first came
to the shelter, it felt good.

53:39.160 --> 53:43.068
Like I was finally an adult,
living on my own.

53:45.868 --> 53:48.777
When I came to
Seoul with your mom...

53:52.827 --> 53:56.652
it felt like I was studying abroad.

54:03.785 --> 54:08.860
At the shelter, when she told me
I could be her daughter from then on,

54:09.743 --> 54:12.527
and that we should live together...

54:14.202 --> 54:16.860
It was the first time

54:18.327 --> 54:22.610
I felt like I had a family.

54:26.160 --> 54:29.152
That's why I was happy, moron.

54:40.147 --> 54:42.993
At least she was fair.

54:42.993 --> 54:44.660
Do you remember?

54:44.660 --> 54:48.402
She cut a towel in half
and made us share it.

55:04.785 --> 55:07.743
[It is impossible to know
where this sticky pit came from.]

55:07.743 --> 55:10.388
[Any creature that falls in
senses death approach.]

55:30.158 --> 55:32.494
I'll start with
the gigolo bar, sir.

55:32.494 --> 55:37.319
Honey... Please...

55:44.785 --> 55:46.693
Dump her.

56:24.421 --> 56:26.121
Mom.

56:27.243 --> 56:29.527
I'll do it for you.

56:32.387 --> 56:35.175
My darling, Mi Sun.

56:43.398 --> 56:45.429
Do you remember?

56:47.277 --> 56:49.907
On my first day of work,

56:52.284 --> 56:54.868
you did my eye makeup for me.

56:54.868 --> 56:56.963
Yeah...

56:58.326 --> 57:01.359
You said my eyes
had to look pretty.

57:04.868 --> 57:07.339
I always...

57:07.339 --> 57:10.372
liked you...

57:15.034 --> 57:17.701
way better.

57:17.701 --> 57:21.818
Do Kyung won't understand me
until I'm gone for good.

57:25.227 --> 57:28.052
Mom, listen.

57:28.743 --> 57:34.063
Don't mix alcohol
and sleeping pills.

57:34.063 --> 57:35.871
Okay?

57:44.243 --> 57:46.215
[Let's Meet]

57:47.034 --> 57:49.576
The ambassador texted me.

57:49.576 --> 57:51.609
I'll be back.

57:56.868 --> 57:58.568
Do Kyung.

57:59.429 --> 58:03.368
Make sure you get
mom's passport too, okay?

58:03.368 --> 58:04.688
Leave the car behind.

58:04.688 --> 58:06.971
Seok Gu knows our car.

58:07.618 --> 58:10.823
Mom's asleep,
so I need to go now.

